msgid "历史文档与版本迁移"
msgstr "Historical documentation and version migration"

msgid ""
"旧 HAL／OSAL／Kconfig 页面描述旧目录、接口、实例生成和所有权规则。它们不能作为 当前 typed "
"factory／静态实例／借用生命周期的规范。本页为旧 URL 提供有版本边界 的入口；不会把旧函数名静默解释为当前公共 API。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy HAL/OSAL/Kconfig pages describe old directories, interfaces, instance"
" generation and ownership. They cannot govern current typed factories, "
"static instances or borrowing lifetimes. This page gives old URLs an "
"explicit version boundary; it never silently interprets old function names "
"as current public APIs."

