msgid ""
"迁移应同时改变配置、接口访问、存储所有权与停止流程，然后对迁移后的源码与 装配重新验证。旧参数、旧 object ID 和相邻配置的结果不能继承到新 "
"bundle。"
msgstr ""
"Migration changes configuration, interface access, storage ownership and "
"shutdown together, then revalidates the migrated source and assembly. Old "
"parameters, object IDs and neighboring configuration results do not transfer"
" to a new bundle."

