msgid ""
"这个固定 revision 只确定旧资料字节，不表示该 revision 的固件得到历史资格。 旧 locale PO 也是历史翻译，不能因当前 "
"language selector 自动成为已审查新译文。 需要离线阅读旧资料时取得上述固定 Git snapshot；当前文档包提供迁移解释和旧 "
"URL alias，不把全部历史教程塞进当前搜索或重新解释其合同。"
msgstr ""
"This fixed revision identifies historical bytes only; it does not grant "
"historical firmware qualification to that revision. Old locale PO files are "
"historical translations, not reviewed current translations selected "
"automatically by the language selector. For offline historical reading, "
"obtain the fixed Git snapshot above. The current documentation package "
"provides migration explanations and legacy URL aliases without adding every "
"historical tutorial to current search or reinterpreting its contract."

msgid "旧地址如何处理"
msgstr "How old addresses are handled"

msgid ""
"{download}`URL 迁移表 <redirects.csv>`列出旧 RST 对应路径、语言和目标页。 `en/`、`zh_CN/` "
"旧地址分别保留。公开站点根 `api/index.html` 是历史 API 边界 入口，引导读者确认版本后选择迁移说明；它不能静默解释为当前 API。"
" 当前公共 API 位于不可变版本根的 `versions/<release_id>/api/index.html`， 或解压后离线包根的 "
"`api/index.html`。判断地址时必须同时确认所属版本根。 旧 HAL／OSAL／Kconfig "
"等不同语义的路径进入本页，明确版本边界后再选迁移指南。 当前上一轮简版 Sphinx 同义入口可进入对应新页。alias 是本地 HTML 和相对链接，"
" 不依赖 JavaScript、CDN 或外部跳转服务。"
msgstr ""
"The {download}`URL migration table <redirects.csv>` lists legacy RST paths, "
"languages and target pages. Old `en/` and `zh_CN/` addresses remain "
"separate. Public site root `api/index.html` is a historical API boundary "
"entry directing readers to confirm the version before choosing migration "
"guidance; it cannot silently mean the current API. Current public APIs live "
"within an immutable version at the site-relative path "
"`versions/<release_id>/api/index.html`, or at `api/index.html` under an "
"extracted offline package root. Always identify the enclosing version root "
"when interpreting an address. Legacy HAL/OSAL/Kconfig paths with different "
"semantics enter this page to establish their version boundary before "
"migration. Equivalent entries from the preceding simplified Sphinx site can "
"enter corresponding current pages. Aliases are local HTML with relative "
"links, without JavaScript, CDN or external redirection services."

msgid ""
"{download}`页面迁移与权威映射 <../design/documentation-migration.csv>`记录源页面、权威、读者任务、 "
"实际站点去向与保留规则。原合同和结果路径保留，链接原文或派生视图，避免建立第二份 状态和规范。后续路径变化应同步映射、导航、alias 和离线检查。"
msgstr ""
"The {download}`page migration and authority map <../design/documentation-"
"migration.csv>` records source pages, authority, reader tasks, actual site "
"destinations and retention rules. Preserve original contract and result "
"paths, linking originals or derived views rather than creating a second "
"status or specification authority. Subsequent path changes update mappings, "
"navigation, aliases and offline checks together."
